排队：非高峰期去的，没有排队\n全五星好评","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/8p6L67Bn2kLORnqGAkb27G5Eo0lxCQ4CG1VLjKKqQZjMwlUyAC2VClvLYN-JQqHkElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/4ldf2TFwM3dnmN-rHRdM-2LDM58XMsMDSm3Ygp6nCB8Y2twOUW2lCX-UHLE0SC1NElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/VLZ7d7js2OENA7CCDo9jDmGIcruzs9qyzK91ylZJuD_v1wSoH_-B3AQbBJTOwoD1Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3368414794","user":"柳**","time":"7月27日","star":5,"text":"炎炎夏日来这家店吃了一碗超满足的米粉，肉沫给的是我预想中的两倍多，身为江西人真的负责任地说这家店的味道确实正宗，然后还有一个点就是食材很干净，吃的进去看得出来原材料，口味也是自己可以调的，有十多种小菜可以加，我自己想吃清淡所以只加了一点点，就是店面有点难找，要从浏阳啥的进去走到底右边拐一下就是，其实是同一家店\n口味：「老衡阳原汤鲜肉粉」\n环境：复古\n服务：好\n性价比：高，好吃不贵\n👫🏻排队：不需要","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/3Eq23n28ZYP328GEIwJHprXt6sK2rQhtGiXN6cnxeLi1ovUUYcQmuIVWE256KpcHElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/TFwET2i8q7HdPYMDlRMFas6NYh-udn90W7uEGp4_WRzPrCgmK_R3zLHnOWEB1I4wElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]}],"complaints":[{"id":"3431900650","user":"匿**","time":"9月3日","star":5,"text":"点了推荐的筒子骨汤粉，这个肉非常咸，汤也非常咸，只有咸味的味道，用来掩盖肉不新鲜，不知道加了什么，口很渴特别想喝水，导致我后续一直在喝水。\n粉是那种渣渣的，粗糙的口感，没法吃。怪不得饭点店里只有我一个人在吃，避雷","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/3yxowF5QMfA4k0B60dR1vqCpbdv2Cd5AZiMZsLjcj42j9Owo5UflXtJsqtuvakkgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/3QFYZwMCkAY7Gj0PS4OY2UYpWFAi1NQ4uGLp_mG8Ae6A3p2d3XSVQmEcH9UYMGI_Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3372926881","user":"匿**","time":"7月30日","star":5,"text":"老板抱歉要给你差评了，虽然我是一个领免费菜的，\n第一，小菜回收，萝卜有很明显的牙印，别人咬了一口，你回收了，^o^重复利用嘛。\n第二，碗里正好有根头发，请看最后一张图，我弄出来了。\n\n老板，做生意要讲良心呀，虽然知道部分店会回收利用，但是已经第一次碰到，","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/-NvhA8vp7kOYmkq_2s4NO9Yw1OwbuODpF7sezsXA81k4vgww1ZcZZ_LC0b5tTBBwElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/ROtekF8ocauXmyhFch8dcjsUfb_mqNYSF2Zuc78p1N7oEswSqAaRQB